-- The house style rule (app/lib/ai.server.ts STYLE_RULE) names the habits current Claude models were seen to write
-- on 2026-10-25 (Capsid foxing/ai-writing-tells.md) in place of the old word list (delve, tapestry, landscape), which
-- those models no longer write. Rewritten only if it was not edited live.
UPDATE settings SET value = 'Writing style (strict): Do NOT use em dashes (the long dash character) anywhere; use commas, periods, parentheses, or colons instead. Do not end on a verdict about the episode''s worth or staying power (''stays with you'', ''remains one of the most''), and leave out blurb adjectives (unforgettable, haunting, sweeping, poignant, profound). No ''not just X, it''s Y'' and no ''it isn''t about X, it''s about Y''. A list of three only when there are three real things. Write plain, direct, varied, human sentences.'
  WHERE key = 'ai.prompt.style' AND value = 'Writing style (strict): Do NOT use em dashes (the long dash character) anywhere; use commas, periods, parentheses, or colons instead. Avoid AI-writing tells such as: delve, tapestry, spans, landscape, realm, navigate, testament to, boasts, stands as, the phrasing ''not just X, it''s Y'', overwrought three-item lists, and grandiose closing sentences. Write plain, direct, varied, human sentences.';
